cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "object_detector_husky: graph neural network refinement of frozen YOLOv8 detections for ROS 2"
authors:
  - family-names: "Khalili Sadaghiani"
    given-names: "Abdolvahab"
    email: "abdolvahab.khalili.sadaghiani@liu.se"
    affiliation: "Department of Electrical Engineering, Linköping University, Linköping, Sweden"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4870-2768"
repository-code: "https://github.com/VKHS/object_detector_husky"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A ROS 2 (ament_python) package that refines the bounding boxes of a frozen
  YOLOv8 detector with a lightweight graph neural network. The top-N detections
  of an image become graph nodes, IoU and k-nearest-neighbour edges weighted by
  overlap and centre distance connect them, and a GCN predicts an additive
  corner correction for every box. Only the GNN, its feature MLP and a class
  embedding are trained, with a Smooth-L1 loss on greedily matched ground truth.
keywords:
  - object detection
  - bounding-box refinement
  - graph neural networks
  - YOLOv8
  - ROS 2
